External benchmark datasets are separately attributed in benchmarks/manifest.yaml:
- UCI Online Retail II, DOI 10.24432/C5CG6D, recorded as CC-BY-4.0.
- UCI Individual Household Electric Power Consumption, DOI 10.24432/C58K54,
  recorded as CC-BY-4.0.
- Wikimedia pageview aggregates, recorded as CC0-1.0, with source and access
