Dataset source files, prepared observations, and any redistribution of them
remain subject to their own terms. Transformations and availability/timezone
assumptions are recorded in the manifest. Synthetic scenarios are labeled and
excluded from observed benchmark scores. The bundled minimal observations are
synthetic example data, not a redistribution of those external datasets.
